        <mxCell id="xta5ETJHjGwa7LrN_Mvo-167" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#6600CC);" value="&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Different victim responses&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;HSE and the Irish Government publicly refused to pay.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;UnitedHealth Group’s CEO authorised a ransom payment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Victim payment or refusal is not an attacker action and therefore is not&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;connected to an AND/OR gate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;PWC, p.1; WIT, p.3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="340" width="253" x="-160" y="-1390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xta5ETJHjGwa7LrN_Mvo-168" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#331A00);" value="&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;Business Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchor&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 70%;&quot;&gt;Both organisations supported highly interconnected and time critical healthcare services. This allowed disruption inside one organisation to move to hospitals, clinicians, pharmacies, claims processing, payments and patient care.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;PWC, p.1; OFR, pp.1–3, 5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
